    "detailed_description": "<strong>Get Bento!</strong> is a bento box-building puzzle game.<br><br>Design sushi and add them to your bento box for today's lunch. Sort and arrange your tasty treats neatly, ensuring they all fit into your lunch box.<br><br>Get Bento! follows a young girl during her holiday break as she packs delicious snacks into her bento box to take to her summer job.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Lunch Box</strong><br>80 cutesy hand drawn sushi and other bento box tasties for you to collect and arrange in your lunch box.<br></li><li><strong>Levels</strong><br>The games has 100 levels designd to stimulate your puzzling needs.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Arcade Modes</strong><br>If you can't get enough of organising sushi into your bento box you'll love the extra modes crafted to keep the fun going indefinitely.<br></li><li><strong>Steam Deck</strong><br>The game is the perfect relaxation game built for the steam deck and controller but works beautifully with a mouse too.</li></ul>",
